     _h_i_n_t_._i_s_p_._N_._d_e_b_u_g
             A hint value for a driver debug level (see the file
             _/_u_s_r_/_s_r_c_/_s_y_s_/_d_e_v_/_i_s_p_/_i_s_p_v_a_r_._h for the values.

     _h_i_n_t_._i_s_p_._N_._v_p_o_r_t_s
