     _h_i_n_t_._i_s_p_._N_._n_o_f_c_t_a_p_e
             Set this to 1 to disable FC-Tape operation on the given isp in‐
             stance.

     _h_i_n_t_._i_s_p_._N_._f_c_t_a_p_e
